(CLAUSE 1: Guideline 5.2 \(Pre-Monsoon Desilting & Bund Standards\)) Tj T*
(All tank bunds exhibiting gullies, piping, or freeboard below 1.5 meters above) Tj T*
(Maximum Water Level \(MWL\) must be prioritised for pre-monsoon strengthening using) Tj T*
(excavated tank-bed silt prior to October 1st.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CLAUSE 2: Guideline 7.1 \(Public Display Board & Geo-Tagged Photographs\)) Tj T*
(Every Kudimaramath work site must display a permanent Tamil information board) Tj T*
(stating tank ayacut, estimate amount, depth of desilting, and officer contact,) Tj T*
(supported by before, during, and after geo-tagged photographs.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
